      "purposeInStoryline": "This opening lesson launches the Kericho courtyard phenomenon, reveals the critical gap in learners' prior knowledge (no perpendicular height is available), and equips them with the first new formula — A = ½ab sin C — which they immediately apply to two triangular sections of the courtyard scale drawing, beginning the journey toward ordering the correct amount of tiling material.",
